      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 3.32,
          "en": "Here's another feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.32,
          "end": 5.2,
          "en": "which can be useful,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.2,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "especially used in conjunction with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 9.61,
          "en": "navigation guards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.61,
          "end": 12.77,
          "en": "And that would be a Route Meta Fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.77,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "On any given route in your route config,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 17.32,
          "en": "you could add a extra property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.32,
          "end": 19.65,
          "en": "the meta property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.65,
          "end": 22.21,
          "en": "Meta takes any kind of value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.21,
          "end": 24.09,
          "en": "for example an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 26.57,
          "en": "and you can store any kind of values in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.57,
          "end": 27.693,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.573,
          "end": 31.87,
          "en": "needsAuth set to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.87,
          "end": 34.1,
          "en": "but this is entirely up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.1,
          "end": 35.99,
          "en": "Why could this be useful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.99,
          "end": 39.36,
          "en": "Well, you can access this meta field in all the places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 40.97,
          "en": "where the route object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.97,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "the dollar sign route object is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 46.13,
          "en": "And that's the case inside of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.13,
          "end": 48.5,
          "en": "and with that you could pass data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.5,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "into a component which is loaded for this route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 54.95,
          "en": "but you can also use it in your navigation guards",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.95,
          "end": 57.11,
          "en": "because there you also got access to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.11,
          "end": 59.86,
          "en": "to and from route objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.86,
          "end": 62.05,
          "en": "And you could then for example add meta",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.05,
          "end": 64.62,
          "en": "like this to indicate that this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.62,
          "end": 66.63,
          "en": "needs authentication,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.63,
          "end": 70.16,
          "en": "to then go to the Global beforeEach route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.16,
          "end": 73.31,
          "en": "and check if the route you're going to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.31,
          "end": 77.65299999999999,
          "en": "in it's meta field needsAuth, if that's truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.61,
          "end": 80.3,
          "en": "And then here you could check whether",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 80.3,
          "end": 81.92,
          "en": "the user is authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81.92,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "For the moment I'll just log Needs auth!,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 85.56,
          "en": "but here you could then check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 85.56,
          "end": 87.75,
          "en": "whether a user is authenticated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 90.7,
          "en": "and if that is the case, you confirm this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 90.7,
          "end": 93.05,
          "en": "and otherwise you deny this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.05,
          "end": 96.25999999999999,
          "en": "With that you could use a global navigation guard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 96.25999999999999,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "that runs for every route, to then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 101.52000000000001,
          "en": "still do different things based on the meta data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 101.52000000000001,
          "end": 103.563,
          "en": "attached to the different routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.46000000000001,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "And that is something which also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 106.97999999999999,
          "end": 109.21000000000001,
          "en": "can be useful to elegantly setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 109.21000000000001,
          "end": 111.62,
          "en": "a global navigation guard that still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 111.62,
          "end": 114.50999999999999,
          "en": "does different things based on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 117.193,
          "en": "the meta data you attached to a route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 118.12,
          "end": 120.43,
          "en": "It's an advanced concept you'll definitely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 120.43,
          "end": 122.9,
          "en": "not need it all the time, but having",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 122.9,
          "end": 125.17,
          "en": "this extra data which you can pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 125.17,
          "end": 127.9,
          "en": "into a component and into this route object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 127.9,
          "end": 130.83,
          "en": "more importantly when a certain route is matched,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 130.83,
          "end": 132.823,
          "en": "can be useful at times.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
